* "You are the driver for this project": `{{AGENTCOOP}} project add --driver self --as {{AGENT_NAME}}`, then check the board and start watching
* "Join this project" or "Join the <name> co-op": `{{AGENTCOOP}} join --as {{AGENT_NAME}}` plus the words they used
* "Join the <project> co-op and start working", or "Start working": check the board, answer what is waiting, and start watching
* "Stop" or "Stop checking": stop your own watch loop and tell the person in one line
